ngton, Wisconsin and Wyoming.\r\n\r\nThese vehicles are equipped with certain air bag air bag inflators assembled as part of the frontal air bag modules, and used as original equipment or replacement equipment (such as after a vehicle crash necessitating replacement of the original air bags), may explode due to propellant degradation occurring after long-term exposure to higher absolute humidity, temperature and temperature cycling.","consequence":"An inflator explosion may result in sharp metal fragments striking the driver or other occupants resulting in serious injury or death.","remedy":"Honda will notify owners, and dealers will replace the passenger frontal air bag inflator, free of charge. The recall began November 6, 2018.  Owners may contact Honda customer service at 1-888-234-2138.  Honda's numbers for this recall are M2J and S2K.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":1355406,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=18V661000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":41,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"INSIGHT"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"ACURA","model":"TSX"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"FIT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"ACURA","model":"ZDX"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CROSSTOUR"},{"year":"2013","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC HYBRID"},{"year":"2012","make":"ACURA","model":"TSX"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"INSIGHT"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"FIT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2013